---
id: contact-option
---

One selectable person in a list of contacts: a radio whose row shows the
person. The row is the design system's; the person is the consumer's, as a
Contact.

## Visual Contract

<Page>
  <Component name="ContactOption" status="stable" implements="hwc-radio"
    layoutMode="HORIZONTAL" primaryAxisSizingMode="AUTO" counterAxisSizingMode="AUTO"
    itemSpacing="{space#sm}" counterAxisAlignItems="CENTER"
    paddingLeft="{space#sm}" paddingRight="{space#sm}" paddingTop="{space#xs}" paddingBottom="{space#xs}"
    cornerRadius="{radius#md}" fills="{surface#control}">
    <Frame name="ring" width={16} height={16} cornerRadius="{radius#full}"
      strokes="{border#default}" strokeWeight={1} fills="{surface#control}"
      layoutMode="HORIZONTAL" primaryAxisAlignItems="CENTER" counterAxisAlignItems="CENTER">
      <Vector name="dot" part="checked-indicator" visible={false} width={8} height={8} fills="{surface#accent}"
        vectorPaths={[{ windingRule: 'NONZERO', data: 'M4 0a4 4 0 110 8 4 4 0 010-8z' }]} />
    </Frame>
    <Frame name="who" layoutMode="VERTICAL" primaryAxisSizingMode="AUTO" counterAxisSizingMode="AUTO">
      <Text name="name" characters="{item.name}" fontSize={14} fills="{text#default}" />
      <Text name="email" characters="{item.email}" fontSize={12} fills="{text#muted}" />
    </Frame>
  </Component>
</Page>

<Styles>
  <Style state="checked" ring:strokes="{surface#accent}" checked-indicator:visible={true} />
  <Style state="hover" root:fills="{surface#raised}" />
  <Style state="focus" ring:strokes="{border#focus}" />
  <Style state="disabled" root:opacity="{opacity#disabled}" />
</Styles>

## Contract

<Props>
  <Prop name="item" model="{models#Contact}">The person this option stands for. Display-ready; nothing is derived here.</Prop>
  <Prop name="checked" type="boolean" default={false} controllable visual>Whether this option is the chosen one.</Prop>
  <Prop name="disabled" type="boolean" default={false} visual>Inert and dimmed.</Prop>
  <Prop name="value" type="string">Submitted when chosen; normally the contact's id.</Prop>
  <Prop name="name" type="string">Form field name, shared with the group.</Prop>
</Props>
<Events>
  <Event name="change" detail="{ checked: boolean }">Fires when this option becomes the chosen one.</Event>
</Events>
<States structural={['checked']} styling={['hover', 'focus', 'disabled']} />
<Parts>checked-indicator</Parts>
<Composes with="ContactList" />

## Models

<Model name="Contact">
  One person as a row shows them. Every value is display-ready; the adapter that builds it does any formatting.
  <Field name="id" type="string" key sample={['ada', 'grace', 'linus']}>Stable identity, used for keys and as the submitted value.</Field>
  <Field name="name" type="string" sample={['Ada Lovelace', 'Grace Hopper', 'Linus Torvalds']}>Full display name.</Field>
  <Field name="email" type="string" optional sample={['ada@example.com', null, 'linus@example.com']}>Omitted when unknown; the row hides the line.</Field>
</Model>

## Behavior

- choose: click, or arrow keys within the group, makes this the chosen option and unchooses the others.
- form: the group submits the chosen option's `value` under the shared `name`.
